sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User / Animator
    participant UI as Fullscreen Stage HUD
    participant Manager as VrmManager
    participant Loader as GLTFLoader + VRMLoaderPlugin
    participant Three as Three.js Scene

    User->>UI: Selects .vrm file (Click Picker or Drag-and-Drop)
    UI->>UI: Show parsing badge & progress overlay
    UI->>Manager: loadFromFile(file, onProgress)
    
    Manager->>Manager: Validate file extension (.vrm) & size (<100MB)
    alt Invalid Extension or Empty File
        Manager-->>UI: Reject Promise with ValidationError
        UI->>UI: Restore UI state, display Toast notification
    end

    Manager->>Manager: Create ObjectURL & increment LoadToken
    Manager->>Loader: loadAsync(objectUrl)
    Loader-->>Manager: Return GLTF object

    alt Non-VRM GLTF / Missing Metadata
        Manager-->>UI: Reject Promise ("VRM metadata not detected")
        UI->>UI: Display actionable error toast (not generic crash)
    end

    Manager->>Manager: disposeCurrent() (Free previous meshes & textures)
    Manager->>Three: avatarRoot.add(vrm.scene)

    alt VRM Version is 0.x
        Manager->>Manager: VRMUtils.rotateVRM0(vrm) (Align +Z to -Z)
    else VRM Version is 1.0
        Manager->>Manager: Maintain canonical -Z forward orientation
    end

    Manager->>Three: Update matrix world & compute Box3
    Manager->>Three: Set position.y = -box.min.y (Ground feet to y=0)
    Manager->>Manager: Cache normalized bone nodes & hips node
    Manager-->>UI: Resolve Promise { vrm, metadata, diagnostics }

    UI->>UI: Update avatar status badge, enable Remove button
    UI->>Manager: Re-bind current motion data & update frame pose
